This API allows you to list and restore backups for your cPanel and WordPress Web Hosting service.

USAGE:
  scw webhosting <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  backup              Backups
  backup-item         Backups items
  control-panel       Control Panels
  database            Database
  database-user       Database User
  dns-records         Domain information commands
  domain              Domain information commands
  domain-availability Domain information commands
  freedomain          Free domains
  ftp-account         FTP Account
  hosting             Hosting management commands
  mail-account        Mail Account
  offer               Offer
  progress            Progresses
  website             Website

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for webhosting
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use

Use "scw webhosting [command] --help" for more information about a command.
